{"type": "result", "subtype": "success", "is_error": false, "duration_ms": 975878, "duration_api_ms": 906898, "num_turns": 45, "result": "Review complete. Summary of the evaluation:\n\n**ReLMCodec** (arXiv 2608.08286v1) — Weak Accept (7.16/10)\n\nKey strengths:\n- Rigorous controlled probing protocol (24 representations, unified P-VQ + Qwen2-1.5B) isolating the key variable: pre-quantization phoneme structure strongly correlates with token predictability (Spearman ρ=0.911, p<0.001)\n- PAPA parameterization achieves predictability gains without adding parameters (CKA 0.61→0.95 vs direct adaptation)\n- At 800 bps single-codebook,全面 leads 14 released baseline checkpoints on all 6 reconstruction metrics; downstream TTS WER drops from 9.49 to 4.93\n\nKey weaknesses:\n- WavLM serves dual role as training teacher and SIM evaluation embedder — partial circularity risk\n- Individual components (residual adaptation, post-quantization teacher distillation) have precedents; novelty is primarily in the combination and diagnosis-driven design\n- Code/checkpoints not yet released (\"upon acceptance\"), limiting immediate reproducibility", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "session_id": "de1bd4b6-a33b-443c-b64d-fddc18c0714d", "total_cost_usd": 3.6305150000000004, "usage": {"input_tokens": 692268, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 6767, "server_tool_use": {"web_search_requests": 0, "web_fetch_requests": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "inference_geo": "", "iterations": [], "speed": "standard"}, "modelUsage": {"GLM-5.2-w4a8": {"inputTokens": 692268, "outputTokens": 6767, "cacheReadInputTokens": 0, "cacheCreationInputTokens": 0, "webSearchRequests": 0, "costUSD": 3.6305150000000004, "contextWindow": 200000, "maxOutputTokens": 32000}}, "permission_denials": [], "fast_mode_state": "off", "uuid": "89a4faef-fac0-4e05-8133-dca35d2c02fa"}
